#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:181 includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:516
#: includes/wpematicohk_sintax.php:44
msgid "Security check."
msgstr "Comprobación de seguridad."

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:214
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Resumen"

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:216
msgid "What this does"
msgstr "Qué hace esto"

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:217
msgid ""
"WPeMatico announces every step of its work through hooks: it is about to "
"read an item, it has built a title, it is ready to insert a post. This "
"plugin lets you write PHP that runs at those moments, without a child theme "
"and without an FTP client."
msgstr ""
"WPeMatico anuncia cada paso de su trabajo mediante hooks: está por leer un "
"ítem, armó un título, está listo para insertar una entrada. Este plugin te "
"permite escribir PHP que se ejecuta en esos momentos, sin tema hijo y sin "
"cliente FTP."

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:218
msgid ""
"Pick a hook, press <strong>Add Function</strong>, and an editor opens with "
"the function signature already written. Fill in the body and save."
msgstr ""
"Elige un hook, pulsa <strong>Agregar función</strong> y se abre un editor "
"con la firma de la función ya escrita. Completa el cuerpo y guarda."

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:219
msgid ""
"Only users who may edit plugins or themes can reach this screen: the code "
"written here runs with the rights of the site itself."
msgstr ""
"Solo los usuarios que pueden editar plugins o temas llegan a esta pantalla: "
"el código que se escribe aquí se ejecuta con los permisos del sitio mismo."

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:224
msgid "Writing the code"
msgstr "Escribir el código"

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:226
msgid "What goes in the editor"
msgstr "Qué va en el editor"

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:227
msgid ""
"The function body, and the function itself &mdash; the signature the editor "
"writes for you already carries the parameters that hook receives, in the "
"right order. Do not rename it: that name is what gets attached to the hook."
msgstr ""
"El cuerpo de la función, y la función misma &mdash; la firma que el editor "
"escribe por ti ya lleva los parámetros que recibe ese hook, en el orden "
"correcto. No le cambies el nombre: ese nombre es el que se engancha al hook."

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:228
msgid "Filters must return something"
msgstr "Los filtros tienen que devolver algo"

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:229
msgid ""
"a filter is asked for a value and whatever it answers replaces the original. "
"A filter that returns nothing empties the thing it was filtering. Actions "
"return nothing and are just told that something happened."
msgstr ""
"a un filtro se le pide un valor y lo que conteste reemplaza al original. Un "
"filtro que no devuelve nada vacía lo que estaba filtrando. Las acciones no "
"devuelven nada: solo se les avisa que algo pasó."

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:230
msgid "The badge next to each hook says which it is"
msgstr "La etiqueta al lado de cada hook dice cuál es"

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:231
msgid ""
"<em>filter</em> or <em>action</em>, so you can tell at a glance whether a "
"return is expected."
msgstr ""
"<em>filter</em> o <em>action</em>, así se ve de un vistazo si se espera un "
"return."

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:232
msgid "The code is checked before it is saved"
msgstr "El código se revisa antes de guardarlo"

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:233
msgid ""
"a syntax error is reported with its line and reason and nothing is stored, "
"so a typo cannot leave the site unable to load. The check runs in place and "
"needs no connection back to your own server, which is what makes it work on "
"managed and firewalled hosting."
msgstr ""
"un error de sintaxis se informa con su línea y su motivo y no se guarda "
"nada, así una errata no puede dejar el sitio sin cargar. La revisión corre "
"en el lugar y no necesita ninguna conexión de vuelta a tu propio servidor, "
"que es lo que la hace funcionar en hostings administrados y detrás de un "
"firewall."

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:234
msgid "One function per hook"
msgstr "Una función por hook"

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:235
msgid ""
"each entry declares its own function, so two entries must not declare "
"functions of the same name. PHP cannot recover from that."
msgstr ""
"cada entrada declara su propia función, así que dos entradas no pueden "
"declarar funciones con el mismo nombre. PHP no puede recuperarse de eso."

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:240
msgid "The editor"
msgstr "El editor"

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:242
msgid "Working in the editor"
msgstr "Trabajar en el editor"

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:243
msgid ""
"It is the same code editor WordPress uses for its own file editors, with PHP "
"highlighting, bracket matching and line numbers."
msgstr ""
"Es el mismo editor de código que usa WordPress en sus propios editores de "
"archivos, con resaltado de PHP, coincidencia de paréntesis y numeración de "
"líneas."

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:244
msgid "Colour scheme"
msgstr "Esquema de colores"

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:245
msgid ""
"Monokai, Blackboard or Cobalt. It changes nothing but how the editor looks, "
"and it is remembered for you alone."
msgstr ""
"Monokai, Blackboard o Cobalt. No cambia nada más que el aspecto del editor, "
"y se recuerda solo para ti."

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:246
msgid "The hook filter above the list"
msgstr "El filtro de hooks arriba de la lista"

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:247
msgid ""
"narrows the long list to one hook while you work, so you are not scrolling "
"past the ones you are not using. It does not delete or disable anything."
msgstr ""
"acota la lista larga a un solo hook mientras trabajas, así no tienes que "
"pasar de largo los que no estás usando. No borra ni desactiva nada."

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:248
msgid "Saving"
msgstr "Guardar"

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:249
msgid ""
"either button on this screen saves the whole tab, and both run the check "
"first."
msgstr ""
"cualquiera de los dos botones de esta pantalla guarda toda la pestaña, y los "
"dos hacen la revisión primero."

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:270
msgid "Hooks"
msgstr "Hooks"

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:321
msgid "Add a hook"
msgstr "Agregar un hook"

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:323
msgid ""
"Pick the hook you want to run code on and press Add Function: an editor "
"opens below with the signature already written for you. The theme only "
"changes how that editor looks."
msgstr ""
"Elige el hook en el que quieres ejecutar código y pulsa Agregar función: "
"abajo se abre un editor con la firma ya escrita por ti. El tema solo cambia "
"el aspecto de ese editor."

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:325
msgid "Select theme for the editor"
msgstr "Elige el tema del editor"

#: includes/wpematicohk_settings.php:327
